id=ke7_microg_keepalive
name=KE7 microG Keepalive
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=mk
description=Restarts ReVanced microG (app.revanced.android.gms) within ~15s if it is killed. Android's Clear-all in Recents kills any app without a foreground service; microG has none, so YouTube then fails with a microG help page. Also re-applies the Doze whitelist at boot.
